                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A perfect game to develop to the \"Minimalism\" of arthritis on the wrist and hand... for having tested this game on the keyboard. \n\nThe controls are not precise and the cube is a real soap. \n\nAlso the keyboard only supports \"qwerty\" mode. \n\nYou have to change the system settings of the keyboard outside of the game to play it in \"azerty\" mode. \n\nFinally, no Steam cards... in free to play.\n\nPositives: This game is compatible with Linux via \"Proton\"...",
